Categories: transitive-include and implementation-specific. 1. The amalgamated
singleheader/simdjson.h calls std::isspace without <cctype>, basictests.cpp POSIX newlocale
without <locale.h>, and the perfdiff benchmark exit without <cstdlib> (libstdc++ declares them
through <string> and <iostream>); adds the includes. 2. The vendored fast_float
(include/simdjson/internal/fast_float.h and the amalgamation) asserts
numeric_limits<std::bfloat16_t>::is_iec559: whether bfloat16 adheres to ISO/IEC 60559 is not
settled by the draft ([numeric.limits.members]/53 Note 1 names float16_t to float128_t only;
[basic.extended.fp]/6: ISO/IEC 60559 names no such format; GCC predefines __BFLT16_IS_IEC_60559__
as 0); libycxx answers false, libstdc++ true. The assertion only restates the parser's assumption
about the bit layout, which another static_assert checks; removed.

